  "body": "Per discussions leading up to https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1468#issuecomment-707930060 there is a growing consensus that patterns should be passed to the service worker API as strings and not objects.\r\n\r\nWhile that integration will ultimately be spec'd in the service worker repo I'm filing an issue here to track it and for eventually updating the explainer.",
